00:33:06,284 --> 00:33:08,509
with a negative delta, an average

518
00:33:08,509 --> 00:33:14,073
number, and when you get the wow number, a very big number in that direction.

519
00:33:16,176 --> 00:33:19,076
There will be times where you have,

520
00:33:19,076 --> 00:33:21,976
say, a bar, like you get a

521
00:33:21,976 --> 00:33:24,876
negative delta, then a big positive delta.

522
00:33:25,176 --> 00:33:31,376
Look for a little bit of follow-through in the direction that the delta is telling you.

523
00:33:31,376 --> 00:33:34,076
In this case, it's telling you there's a lot of selling coming in.

524
00:33:34,576 --> 00:33:36,476
Your direction should be looking to go lower.

