00:34:32,876 --> 00:34:36,476
So like I said, take everything into context with what's happening in the market.

541
00:34:39,612 --> 00:34:44,212
So small delta numbers, both positive and negative, indicate the market is balanced.

542
00:34:44,212 --> 00:34:47,253
It's trading at a level where both buyers and sellers

543
00:34:47,253 --> 00:34:49,078
are happy with the price that

544
00:34:49,078 --> 00:34:51,511
is being traded, and trade is being facilitated.

545
00:34:51,512 --> 00:34:54,512
The market is doing what the market is supposed to do.

546
00:34:55,012 --> 00:34:58,112
Small delta numbers, when strung together, are often a sign of absorption.

547
00:34:58,512 --> 00:35:02,812
More importantly, for me, it's a sign of sideways trading or congestion.

548
00:35:03,912 --> 00:35:05,736
What you want to do is you want

549
00:35:05,736 --> 00:35:07,332
to look when you have a series

