00:36:39,912 --> 00:36:43,312
It starts coming out with strong negative delta, minus 1800.

576
00:36:43,712 --> 00:36:48,212
Then again, if you're not yet convinced that this is the move, minus 2000.

577
00:36:49,612 --> 00:36:52,035
So if you're not short based on this bar, by

578
00:36:52,035 --> 00:36:53,246
